            "value" : "Redis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redis cannot store NULL as a value. Enter an empty value instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Redis ne peut pas stocker NULL comme valeur. Saisissez plutôt une valeur vide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redis driver has no TLS fallback. Preferred and Required both force TLS. Use Required for Redis Cloud, Upstash, and AWS ElastiCache encrypted endpoints." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le pilote Redis n’a pas de repli sans TLS. Préféré et Requis imposent tous deux TLS. Utilisez Requis pour les points de terminaison chiffrés de Redis Cloud, Upstash et AWS ElastiCache."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Redis 드라이버는 TLS 폴백을 지원하지 않습니다. ‘선호’와 ‘필수’ 모두 TLS를 강제합니다. Redis Cloud, Upstash 및 AWS ElastiCache 암호화 엔드포인트에는 ‘필수’를 사용하십시오."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Redis sürücüsünde TLS geri dönüşü yoktur. Tercih Edilen ve Zorunlu'nun ikisi de TLS'yi zorunlu kılar. Redis Cloud, Upstash ve AWS ElastiCache şifreli uç noktaları için Zorunlu kullanın."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Driver Redis không có cơ chế dự phòng TLS. Preferred và Required đều buộc dùng TLS. Dùng Required cho Redis Cloud, Upstash và các endpoint mã hóa của AWS ElastiCache."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Redis 驱动没有 TLS 回退。“首选”和“必需”都会强制使用 TLS。连接 Redis Cloud、Upstash 和 AWS ElastiCache 加密端点时请使用“必需”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Redis 驅動程式沒有 TLS 備援。「Preferred」和「Required」都會強制使用 TLS。連接 Redis Cloud、Upstash 和 AWS ElastiCache 加密端點時請使用「Required」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redis queued %@ instead of running it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Redis a mis %@ en file d’attente au lieu de l’exécuter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redis support requires hiredis. Run scripts/build-hiredis.sh first." : {
