          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The run was rolled back, but %@ cannot roll back, so the rows already written there stay. Compare again to see where the target stands." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’exécution a été annulée, mais %@ ne prend pas en charge l’annulation : les lignes déjà écrites y restent donc. Relancez la comparaison pour voir l’état actuel de la cible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The run was rolled back, but %1$@ cannot roll back, so rows already written there stay in %2$@. Compare again to see where it stands." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
